#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_StevensCave/scripts.inc:29
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_StevensCave_Text_ShouldKnowHowGoodIAmExpectWorst"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Oh, wow, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"I'm amazed you knew where to find me.\p"
"Do you, uh…maybe think of me as\n"
"just a rock maniac?\p"
"No, that can't be right.\p"
"We battled alongside each other at\n"
"the SOOTOPOLIS SPACE CENTER.\p"
"You should have a very good idea\n"
"about how good I am.\p"
"Okay, {PLAYER}{KUN}, if you're going to mount\n"
"a serious challenge, expect the worst!$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：哦，哇，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"真没想到你知道在哪里能找到我。\p"
"你是不是……呃……\n"
"觉得我只是个石头迷？\p"
"不，不可能是那样。\p"
"我们曾在琉璃市的宇宙中心并肩作战过。\p"
"你应该很清楚我有多强。\p"
"好吧，{PLAYER}{KUN}，如果你要认真挑战我，\n"
"就做好最坏的打算吧！$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_StevensCave/scripts.inc:42
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_StevensCave_Text_StevenDefeat"
msgid ""
"You…\n"
"I had no idea you'd become so strong…$"
msgstr ""
"你……\n"
"我没想到你已经变得这么强了……$"

#: data/maps/MeteorFalls_StevensCave/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "MeteorFalls_StevensCave_Text_MyPredictionCameTrue"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Come to think of it, ever since\n"
"our paths first crossed in GRANITE\l"
"CAVE in DEWFORD, I had this feeling.\p"
"I thought that you would eventually\n"
"become the CHAMPION.\p"
"My predictions usually come true.\p"
"And where will you go from here?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Fufufu, even I couldn't tell you that.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：说起来，自从我们在武斗镇的石之\n"
"洞窟第一次相遇时，我就有这种感觉了。\p"
"我觉得你终有一天会成为冠军。\p"
"我的预感通常都很准。\p"
"那么，你接下来要去哪里呢？\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"呼呼呼，这个就连我也说不准啊。$"
